# Copy to .env (gitignored) in the repository root, or let `./bellwether token init`
# create it for you with a fresh random value.
#
# bellwether's hook token: a local anti-spoofing value, not an account credential. Claude
# Code sends it as the X-Bellwether-Token header on every hook call; the brain refuses
# calls without it. Use your own random value: 16 or more letters, digits, _ or -.
BELLWETHER_HOOK_TOKEN=
